WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Understand workspace pricing. Review complexity rates, the monthly commitment and scheduled prepayment. All amounts shown are simulated.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Check balance and autopay. The wallet is shared by Insights and Signal within this workspace environment.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Review recharge settings. The trigger balance and amount to add are separate. This example adds CAD 2,500 below CAD 500.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Review payment methods. Sandbox methods are simulated. Do not enter real card or bank details.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Inspect a payment method. Check its type, organization, environment and default status.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Review Product charges. Compare product, borrower, complexity, quantity, unit rate and cost.

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Inspect the historical charge. Use this record's rate version. Earlier demo charges can differ from current workspace prices.

8
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Read the stored billing data. Usage is not a payment receipt. Follow its transaction reference when reconciling the wallet.

9
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Review Funding history. Check succeeded, pending, failed, refunded and returned payments separately from product consumption.

10
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Open a funding record. Confirm amount, currency, status and funding source.

11
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Reconcile the wallet credit. Use credited amount and transaction references. Do not count a payment and its wallet credit twice.
